# The shared Browser (ADR-036): Debian's Chromium, shown in Kura Desktop.
# Only in a PC image built with OS_BROWSER="true"; never on the Raspberry Pi.
# TigerVNC's X server is also the VNC server; xauth makes the display's
# cookie; the window manager keeps Chromium at the window's size.
chromium
tigervnc-standalone-server
xauth
matchbox-window-manager
# The X server's keymap: xkbcomp and its data (a missing keymap stops Xvnc)
x11-xkb-utils
xkb-data
# Fonts for the pages it shows
fonts-liberation
fonts-dejavu-core
